		<h3 class="entry-title"><a data-id="16722" href="https://www.ftuclinics.org.hk/%e6%b5%81%e6%84%9f%e7%96%ab%e8%8b%97%e5%a4%96%e5%b1%95%e6%8e%a5%e7%a8%ae/" class="tpg-post-link" target="_self">流感疫苗外展接種</a></h3></div>
